const reviews: Review[] = [
  { r: '5.0 stars', h: 'Joe is an amazing attorney.', l: `Joe went into the courtroom totally prepared which made me feel very fortunate and confident. It was fascinating to watch him be so creative. Joe is an amazing attorney.`, p: [`This was my first time being arrested, and Joe walked me through the entire process. My case was eventually dismissed,thanks to his knowledge of the fine points of the law. He encourages contacting him even after office hours. His team kept in constant touch with me as well. Joe went into the courtroom totally prepared which made me feel very fortunate and confident. It was fascinating to watch him be so creative. Joe is an amazing attorney.`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Attorney Joe Simon and his team represented me in a white collar crime case, successfully pleading the case such that I avoided jail time. I was scared, nervous, and generally unsure of how things would proceed, this being my first (and last!) time moving through our legal system. Joe explained things clearly and in detail, at every step of the process. I never had to wonder what was next. He had me prepared at every step...`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Joseph represented me in a criminal case since last year. I had never been in trouble before and that was the first time I had gotten arrested/charged with anything and it was a major charge. Joe visited me in jail before I paid him anything! he heard my story and represented me during my bond hearing. I was terrified and Joe was there from the start. I met him and his associate Mike at their office and explained to them what happened. Joe...`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Mr. Simon and his office resources will do everything in the power of the law to take your case on and offer the best possible outcome.`] },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Mr. Simon proved to be an outstanding attorney who has a clear grasp of the law as well as the court system`], w: `Client's Husband` },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Prompt profession service from attorney and support staff. Delivered exactly what he said he would,.`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Joe Simon is AMAZING. As a parent of a son who was facing the scariest time in his life, Joe came highly recommended and exceeded all expectations.`], w: `Client's Parent` },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`I hired the offices of Joseph Simon to help me clear up a myriad of legal issues. Michael Dagher-Margosian was the attorney assigned to my case and he handled it quickly and professionally with as little pain as possible. I would definitely recommend them to anyone seeking legal help in the area.`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`I never thought I'd need a criminal defense lawyer. But I did. I was referred to Joe Simon's office as "the best lawyer in Washtenaw County". I called him and from the very start he was knowledgeable, compassionate, and I trusted him. I came to work with Joe and his associate, Michael. They took care of my case in a seamless manner. I was prepared and kept in the loop about everything. We chose to fight and WON! I am forever grateful to them. If you are having doubts about which lawyer you should hire, look no further!`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', h: 'Exceptional knowledge, expertise, and professionalism.', p: [`From the moment I called, Mr. Simon and his staff were exceptional and I do believe the very positive outcome that resulted in my case was because of his knowledge and expertise.`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Joseph A. Simon was a great help to me regarding a minor incident that occurred in Ann Arbor. His office communicated with me in order to ensure that we completed the process with no problems. I really appreciated the help and would definitely recommend!`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Joe was great with helping me through my legal troubles. He met with me on a Sunday and walked me through everything as well as was very communicative during the whole process. Plus he knows everyone in Ann Arbor so that can help your case out a lot.`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`I hired Joseph based on his reviews online, I am not from EEUU, and I am more than happy that I hired him. He help me a lot in my case since day one, he avoid having me to go back to the EEUU for the pre-trial, among others, and the results achieved are way better than the expected. I higly recommend Joseph he will take good care of you. thank you.`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Mr. Simon did a wonderful job of taking care of my open intoxication citation!`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`I met with Joe to explain the circumstances around my case, he explained all the details relating to my situation and kept me completely informed. Joe spent a lot of time with me prepping me for a trial. He handled my case promptly and thoroughly.`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', h: 'I cannot express how grateful I am for what he did for me.', p: [`I had been blindsided by a felony charge for using self-defense when boyfriend called Joe. I’d never had any issues with the law, but they were still making it impossible for me to live normally. Joe worked so hard to make sure that my case was dismissed and my reputation restored as quickly as possible.`] },
  { r: 'Five Stars', h: 'Joe came highly recommended from a personal friend who is a prosecuting attorney.', l: `I would highly recommend him to anyone who has the misfortune of having a criminal matter befall them. I clearly understand why he is billed as one of the top criminal defense attorneys in the State of Michigan.`, p: [`Joe came highly recommended from a personal friend who is a prosecuting attorney. As someone who had never dealt with the criminal justice system, I was extremely fortunate to have connected with Joe. He walked me through the nuances of the legal process and the strategies he planned to deploy. He dug into the details, doing an excellent job on discovery. As an executive leader, I very much appreciated his depth of knowledge, professionalism, effort, and promptness. Both Joe and Victoria gave their immediate attention whenever I reached out. Every single time I got a response on the spot or within the same day. His efforts secured a full dismissal of my case. However what I appreciated the most was that Joe respected me as a person. He counselled me not only legally but supported me when I was nervous and unsure. As my case unfolded, the professional respect he afforded me transformed into a partnership. He truly cares about his clients. He works in a highly ethical manner to ensure not only the best possible outcomes are achieved, but also that all sides of the story are heard and considered. For that I am forever grateful. I would highly recommend him to anyone who has the misfortune of having a criminal matter befall them. I clearly understand why he is billed as one of the top criminal defense attorneys in the State of Michigan. All my best to Joe, Victoria, and everyone at Simon Law. Job very well done.`], w: 'Client', t: 'Avvo' },
  { r: '5', h: 'Joe is an amazing individual and lawyer...', p: [`No pressure or judgement at consultation and once hired, He and his staff was the calm in the storm I was going through. My ex wife made false DV allegations against me after I filed for divorce for leverage in child custody battle and Joe saved my life!! His proactive and straightforward approach in handling my case gave me more hope as time went by. I'm extremely happy with the end result. No one better!!! Joe is very respected by the Washtenaw county judges and prosecutors.`] },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Joe and his team turned what I thought was a hopeless situation into a completely manageable one. After my first consultation I knew I hired the right people. Their insite and ability to plan a thorough defense is unmatched.`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Did all he could to get my charges lessened. Which he in fact did. turned something bad into something un-heard of! If you want a good chance in the court room, then hire joe and his team.`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`His cross-examination is unreal. His ability to see two steps ahead is magical to watch.`], w: `Client's Parent` },
