  { r: '5.0 stars', h: 'Miracle worker… Satisfied is an understatement…', p: [`This guy goes to work for you and will get the job done!... The BEST expert criminal defense attorney!!`] },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Joe is an amazing individual and lawyer. No pressure or judgement at consultation and once hired, He and his staff was the calm in the storm I was going through. My ex wife made false DV allegations against me after I filed for divorce for leverage in child custody battle and Joe saved my life!! His proactive and straightforward approach in handling my case gave me more hope as time went by. I'm extermely happy with the end result. No one better!!! Joe is very respected by the Washtenaw county judges and prosecutors`] },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`I was recommended to Joe Simon by my real estate attorney who is himself highly regarded in and around the Ann Arbor area. My son had a first offense DUI and of course I wanted to make sure he had the best legal representation available. Joe did not disappoint. To the contrary, I was ecstatic with the outcome. We first met Joe at his office for a consultation where he explained the legal process in detail. I was impressed with...`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`I'm a student at U of M. I got in trouble with the police here and got charged with a serious misdemeanor. I at first sought help from student legal services at my school, but was told that I should "just plead guilty" to my case by the lawyer there. I was hopeless since I am a foreigner and doing so would result in my deportation. That's when I consulted and retained Joe. He is extremely professional. Whenever I send him an email, he would call...`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Joe is an amazing individual and lawyer. No pressure or judgement at consultation and once hired, He and his staff was the calm in the storm I was going through. My ex wife made false DV allegations against me after I filed for divorce for leverage in child custody battle and Joe saved my life!! His proactive and straightforward approach in handling my case gave me more hope as time went by. I'm extermely happy with the end result. No one better!!! Joe is very respected by the Washtenaw county judges and prosecutors.`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Simon is one of the top criminal defense attorneys in Ann Arbor, say his peers`] },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Joseph A Simon is an amazing attorney being both professional and personable, gave me all the confidence that I was in good hands and followed through in making sure I was being taken care of and represented in the best way possible. Can’t thank him enough for all of his help`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`There isn’t a more well-prepared attorney I’ve ever seen... He puts the same care into a drunk driving case as he does a capital case.`] },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Joe went above and beyond our expectations as a counselor. He was instrumental in protecting my son's reputation both in and outside the courthouse.`], w: `Client's Parent` },
  { r: '5.0 stars', h: 'Words cannot describe how AWESOME he is!!!!!!!!', l: `Joe worked tirelessly going over every bit of information relating to the case and submerged himself into understanding every little detail...`, p: [`When I went to see Joe initially, I knew he already had an incredible reputation for working for the best outcome for his clients. Once things got moving on the case preparation, Joe and his staff, put 200% effort into making sure that we were prepared for trial. Joe worked tirelessly going over every bit of information relating to the case and submerged himself into understanding every little detail. We both would often laugh at how our "brains" hurt from all the information we had to go over. Joe was persistent in his continuing negotiations and his demand for discovery information. He would often call me after hours at night and meet with me on the weekends in order to have every bit of this case prepped. In the end, Joe was able to secure a complete dismissal in my case, even before the trial began. Joe's knowledge of the law is second to none and his passion for bringing out the truth only shows his commitment to provide the best legal services to his clients and to the criminal justice system. My family and I are forever grateful for his work and I would recommend Joe and his staff to anyone, anytime. You cannot go wrong. Truly cares about his clients.`] },
  { r: '5.0 stars', p: [`Recently I found out that I had several outstanding legal issues in Michigan I googled defense attorneys in Michigan and I can’t say how great full I am that joe Simons name came up first with in a short time joe handed the warrants out for my arrest and he was able to put this entire matter behind me I would recommend Joe Simon to anyone who needs a great defense attorney`], w: 'Hired attorney' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe and his firm provided the best professional legal counsel and service for my family. As our f...', p: [`Joe and his firm provided the best professional legal counsel and service for my family. As our family dealt with serious legal issues, Joe's guidance and expertise assisted with our successful outcome.`], d: 'a year ago', g: '115981824657280721284' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Mr. Simon is concise, professional and wise. He is also a concilliator. He hones in on what is es...', p: [`Mr. Simon is concise, professional and wise. He is also a concilliator. He hones in on what is essential to create an optimal outcome for a defendant, while maintaining community integrity. Positive Responsiveness, Quality, Professionalism, Value … More`], d: '2 years ago', g: '103778108148929967430' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Absolute Incredible Lawyer! Joe seriously worked a miracle for me with all his hard work. He neve...', p: [`Absolute Incredible Lawyer! Joe seriously worked a miracle for me with all his hard work. He never stopped and really did work out what we thought could have been impossible. Highly recommend Joe!`], d: '3 months ago', g: '102183095397132303192' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'During one of the hardest moments of my life, I was referred to Mr. Joe Simon. I read his reviews...', p: [`During one of the hardest moments of my life, I was referred to Mr. Joe Simon. I read his reviews and saw his awards. And as someone who never thought I'd be in a situation where I'd need a criminal defense attorney, I can say that hiring Joe was the smartest decision I could have made. From the beginning, Joe was thorough and knowledgeable. During a time where everything felt very scary, he always took the time to break everything down so I could understand the process, the language, and the next steps. And his right hand woman, Victoria, always kept me informed and aware of upcoming dates and requests. It was the longest six months of my life, but there is no way I could have navigated the judicial process without Joe on my side. He was no nonsense with me when I needed it, but he also showed humanity and empathy when I needed it. In a system that is set up to focus on dockets and statues and technicalities, Joe knows every tiny detail of that piece but also helps you keep your humanity during the process. His long history with the court meant he also knew the judges and attorneys and had relationships that allowed him to have conversations that helped drive the process forward. Most recently my case got thrown a curveball after we thought all was resolved, and without any hesitation, Joe jumped back into it for me and showed up to court with all the facts and research to support me. I appreciate Joe for so much more than he is. He's not just an attorney that will represent you. He is also a teacher who will educate you along the way. A therapist when you need to have someone hear your side. An advisor who can give you great insight on how to handle the steps ahead. And sometimes even a jokester to help lighten the mood during what can be a very heavy time. If you find yourself in need of a criminal defense attorney, you will not be able to find anyone better than Joe Simon. I will be eternally grateful for all he did for myself and my family.`], d: 'a month ago', g: '115229496165567337915' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'I met with Joe to explain the circumstances around my case, he explained all the details relating...', p: [`I met with Joe to explain the circumstances around my case, he explained all the details relating to my situation and kept me completely informed. Joe spent a lot of time with me prepping me for a trial. He handled my case promptly and thoroughly.`], d: '5 years ago', g: '112627121898256484087' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'I hired Joseph based on his reviews online, I am not from EEUU, and I am more than happy that I h...', p: [`I hired Joseph based on his reviews online, I am not from EEUU, and I am more than happy that I hired him. He help me a lot in my case since day one, he avoid having me to go back to the EEUU for the pre-trial, among others, and the results achieved are way better than the expected. I higly recommend Joseph he will take good care of you. thank you.`], d: '5 years ago', g: '112640057046214168380' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe and Victoria were awesome throughout the whole process! They helped put my mind at ease durin...', p: [`Joe and Victoria were awesome throughout the whole process! They helped put my mind at ease during a very difficult time. If you need a great law firm, I highly recommend attorney Joseph Simon for legal representation.`], d: '5 months ago', g: '116333995476270050468' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Mr. Simon is an amazing attorney. His cross examination was a sight to behold. My wife filed fals...', p: [`Mr. Simon is an amazing attorney. His cross examination was a sight to behold. My wife filed false charges on me, and Joe defended me and literally saved my life. I will be eternally grateful to him. He is very diligent and detail oriented and covered all angles for defense. He is the best criminal defense attorney in Ann Arbor for a reason. Thank you Joe.`], d: 'a year ago', g: '112141571751757833453' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe has and will always be my "go to" attorney. Not only is he great at what he does but he also ...', p: [`Joe has and will always be my "go to" attorney. Not only is he great at what he does but he also cares so much about his clients that he offers advice as needed and referrals to other great attorneys if required. He has a deep network of great attorneys that he works in conjunction with and he also has the respect of other attorneys/prosecutors he goes up against. This mutual respect helps his clients get the best possible outcomes for their cases. Of the cases he has worked for me personally, he has shown a work ethic second to none, great attention to detail and the confidence you want/need in your attorney. For these reasons, and many more, he will always be my first choice. God forbid you should need an attorney, but if you do, Joe should be your first choice too! Take my advice you won't regret it........`], d: '6 years ago', g: '109207326415577127345' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'I am truly impressed by the outstanding legal representation provided by Joe and his team. Their ...', p: [`I am truly impressed by the outstanding legal representation provided by Joe and his team. Their expertise and dedication in handling my case were evident from the beginning. They skillfully navigated the complexities of law, understanding the intricacies of the uncommon situation I was in, in great depth, and leaving no stone unturned to ensure the best possible resolution for me. What stood out the most was the lawyer's commitment to delivering results swiftly. Despite the time-sensitive nature of my case, they worked diligently to expedite the process without compromising the quality of their efforts. Their ability to manage time efficiently while maintaining a high standard of legal practice is commendable. Communication throughout the case was clear and transparent, instilling confidence and alleviating any concerns I had. Joe's team was always available to take my calls and later follow up via emails to make sure the entire process was completed seamlessly. The lawyer's attention to detail and strategic approach demonstrated a deep understanding of DUI laws, and I felt reassured knowing that my case was in capable hands. In the end, the lawyer secured a favorable outcome that exceeded my expectations. Their professionalism, expertise, and efficiency make them an exceptional choice for anyone seeking effective legal representation in DUI/OWI matters. I am genuinely grateful for their efforts and would very highly recommend their services to others facing similar challenges.`], d: '7 months ago', g: '106831646404923017872' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe represented a close family member on more than once occasion and I am entirely genuine when I...', p: [`Joe represented a close family member on more than once occasion and I am entirely genuine when I say his representation most recently saved my loved one the burden of carrying a felony for life. Joe's guidance and strategy made all the difference in the case. We all recognize attorneys are not cheap, and this is the best thousands of dollars that I have ever spent. I do not believe there were better hands for my loved one's fate to be sitting in. Additionally, the response and fast action on his paralegal's part as well as the crazy fast speed Joe got involved right into the case were SO reassuring and gave us the peace of mind that they were all over this. I'm sure they see many MANY worse things than my loved one was facing, but they still operated as if it was the most important thing in our lives at the moment and quite honestly, it was for us. I would ENTHUSIASTICALLY recommend Joe to anyone in need of a defense attorney in the area.`], d: '3 years ago', g: '117694235407077856009' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe was a fantastic lawyer, he really understood what i did wrong and tried his best to help me o...', p: [`Joe was a fantastic lawyer, he really understood what i did wrong and tried his best to help me out. The end result was very satisfying and I say very thank you to him!`], d: '5 years ago', g: '111008746366362340153' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe and Victoria were a great team and helped me every step of the way, day and night. Any and al...', p: [`Joe and Victoria were a great team and helped me every step of the way, day and night. Any and all questions were answered and there knowledge of the law was very apparent. They made a difficult process much easier. I would definitely turn to Joe and his team if ever need again! Thanks Joe!`], d: 'a year ago', g: '116915702686934980478' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'I can 100% guarantee that if your case is anywhere near Ann Arbor, MI there is not a better man o...', p: [`I can 100% guarantee that if your case is anywhere near Ann Arbor, MI there is not a better man on Earth to have by your side. Not only is Joe's knowledge and experience top notch, he truly is a great friend that will fight for you until the very end. He explains legal processes in crystal clear fashion and makes sure you understand any and all possible outcomes of your case. He is extremely well known in Michigan's legal world which makes him a master negotiator with all parties involved. Joseph Simon truly saved my life and I will never ever forget him, and what he has done for me. If anyone seeing this would like more information on Joe, please email me right now and I will talk your ear off of why you need to GO WITH JOE!!`], d: '2 years ago', g: '110685359569010063066' },
  { r: '5.0', h: "Joe is a fantastic lawyer! He's honest with you and realistic about the outcome of a case (doesn't...", p: [`Joe is a fantastic lawyer! He's honest with you and realistic about the outcome of a case (doesn't give you false hope) and works really hard to help and explain in every way possible as well as help prepare you. He really tries to work with you financially, which is super helpful. Also he is BEAST in court! Highly recommend him for criminal cases.`], d: '5 years ago', g: '109723650556498878017' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Scott Vetere', p: [`everything went exactly or better that i was told it would fantastic attorney!!!`], d: '6 months ago', g: '100585667522122462312' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Taki Meza', p: [`Joe is a really good lawyer and an awesome person Positive Responsiveness, Professionalism … More`], d: '3 years ago', g: '116084010360384959982' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'If you want the best Defense Attorney in the Ann Arbor area, Joe Simon is his name. Him and his t...', p: [`If you want the best Defense Attorney in the Ann Arbor area, Joe Simon is his name. Him and his team will go above and beyond and please FOLLOW HIS ADVICE! You won't go wrong. Period.`], d: '4 years ago', g: '112201531049578091462' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Thank you Mr Simon for giving me the best option approaching my case. The day of my trial I was e...', p: [`Thank you Mr Simon for giving me the best option approaching my case. The day of my trial I was expecting the worst, but my case was dismissed. I was almost in tears for the release of tension, and stress. I never thought in a million years that would be caught up in a criminal case. Mr. Simon thank you so much again. Positive Professionalism … More`], d: '2 years ago', g: '115673618850248779569' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Extremely pleased with the representation Joe provided me. He was able to achieve the most favora...', p: [`Extremely pleased with the representation Joe provided me. He was able to achieve the most favorable outcome for me and I am beyond grateful for that. Joe is honest, trustworthy, hardworking, and he cares. He is everything I had hoped for in a lawyer.`], d: '6 years ago', g: '108008055791129656696' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'I highly recommend Joe Simon!! From the first time I spoke with him throughout the entirety of my...', p: [`I highly recommend Joe Simon!! From the first time I spoke with him throughout the entirety of my case he was approachable, knowledgeable and answered all of my questions. He walked me through every step of the process, carefully explaining all potential outcomes. He always kept me up to date, notifying me of any and all updates immediately. Joe has a lot of experience, and is very familiar with the court, which helped tremendously. He was able to make recommendations about interventions I could complete and was always thinking two steps ahead. He was determined and continued to advocate for me. Ultimately Joe obtained the best possible outcome for me, a true grand slam!! Victoria is great, she made sure I had all information regarding meetings, paperwork, and follow up care. She compassionately helped walk me through the process when I did not know what to expect. A very valuable asset to Joe’s team. I cannot say it enough, Joe exceeded my expectations in every way from the beginning to the end. I am so thankful for Joe and his team and the outcome he achieved for me, a true miracle! I would highly recommend Joe Simon for your matter!!`], d: 'a year ago', g: '109084995636656440952' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Gilbert Spence', p: [`Absolutely first rate representation.`], d: '4 years ago', g: '117735745709851728814' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Mr. Simon was referred to me for legal counsel, which I will always be grateful for. My case was ...', p: [`Mr. Simon was referred to me for legal counsel, which I will always be grateful for. My case was not an easy one to argue or defend. Joe was always prepared and seemed to always be one step ahead of the issues the case presented .He always explained the facts to me whether good or bad which I greatly appreciated. Joe put a lot of time and effort into getting me the best outcome in my case. I'm sure he will do the same for you.`], d: '3 years ago', g: '106937914177085047057' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe and his staff are immensely welcoming and helpful. I was beyond nervous before retaining a la...', p: [`Joe and his staff are immensely welcoming and helpful. I was beyond nervous before retaining a lawyer and Joe was the best decision I made in this entire process. I truly believe that his knowledge and expertise gave me the best outcome; above and beyond what I could have hoped for! He was a great listener and available to answer any and all questions (as well as Victoria!). They were both prompt in responses and wonderful at keeping me informed. It was a true weight off my shoulders knowing he was there to support me and had my back. I cannot thank him enough!!`], d: 'a year ago', g: '103987155491986833693' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe Simon is excellent by any measure - reputation, results, communications, responsiveness & sen...', p: [`Joe Simon is excellent by any measure - reputation, results, communications, responsiveness & sensitivity, honesty, dedication, thoroughness, sincerity - our entire family was very pleased with his service during our time of need`], d: '6 years ago', g: '101688997925028473014' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Attorney Joe is truly an excellent lawyer. My case was unique and complex, but he showed unwavering confidence. He ultimately resolved it quickly and accurately, despite not being in the U.S. due to circumstances.', p: [`Attorney Joe is truly an excellent lawyer. My case was unique and complex, but he showed unwavering confidence. He ultimately resolved it quickly and accurately, despite not being in the U.S. due to circumstances. We communicated seamlessly through phone calls and video meetings. Additionally, Victoria at the office was incredibly kind and provided fast and clear updates about the case. They are indeed a highly competent lawyer and team! Don’t hesitate to contact him. The best lawyer in Michigan. You’ll regret hesitating. I highly recommend Attorney Joe! Lastly, I want to thank Joe and his team immensely. Greatly appreciated!!!!`], d: 'a month ago', g: '103253664556380837586' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'After going through my case, I understand why Joe Simon is a great lawyer. In my case, I always f...', p: [`After going through my case, I understand why Joe Simon is a great lawyer. In my case, I always focused on the minor charge, and I tried to guide Joe to focus on the minor charge. I did this because there were many conflicts and flaws in the police report and made a kind of very complicated mutual support between the major and minor charges. However, Joe chose to directly target the major charge and he thoroughly defeated the prosecutor in the court. Following it, the minor charge was automatically dismissed. And my whole family get a chance to celebrate a wonderful valentine’s day. Throughout my case, all what I did is telling Joe all the detail of my case at the beginning. After that I almost became an audience, sitting there and enjoying Joe did all the work. Sometimes very slow. And once he found a chance (I guess), he acted promptly like a tiger or a cobra. Certainly, as I mentioned above, I also tried to distract him from the major charge. It made him worried, and he called me to explain repetitively the rationale of his strategy. After all this, when I think back, I realize if we had followed my strategy, I may have still been fighting in the swamp of this lawsuit. I also really appreciate Victoria’s help. She made everything very smooth, and I did not need to worry about anything. One more thing I must emphasize, there is another attorney (or Joe’s assistant) with small white mustache and beard. He is super knowledgeable and helped us analyze all the details and possible development of my case during our first meeting. Very impressive, but I cannot find his name now.`], d: 'a year ago', g: '115705396717291401628' },
