  { r: '5.0', h: 'Our case involved someone close to me who was arrested for a crime while in a mental health crisi...', p: [`Our case involved someone close to me who was arrested for a crime while in a mental health crisis. Joe handled the matters with the prosecutor, judge and forensic psychologist with amazing care and professionalism. He is a master at building trusting relationships and genuinely cares for his client. He is also a good truth teller. Every step he provided clear expectations, even when the outcome could be unsettling. In the end, we had an extremely favorable outcome. Thanks to Joe and his entire team.`], d: 'a year ago', g: '114881550900527970322' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'My husband had an old case surface and we hired Mr Simon on our behalf. He immediately consulted ...', p: [`My husband had an old case surface and we hired Mr Simon on our behalf. He immediately consulted me with a very fair price and got to work. My husband was contacted by Mr Simon that day while incarcerated, and he saw a judge the next opportunity. His secretary Victoria so kindly gave us instructions on how and where to pick up my husband from the jail upon his release. Mr Simon kept communication with us throughout the entire time between court dates. Not only did Mr Simon get our case closed as soon as possible, but he went above and beyond and got our case closed with as minimal damage as possible given our circumstances. His efforts and skills towards our family is truly appreciated.`], d: '5 months ago', g: '106279655015145648463' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Rafael Senos', p: [`Joe is trust worthy, very well organized with good undestanding, attentive in case preparations.`], d: '2 years ago', g: '106743567252064945744' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'I was a criminal and now I’m NOT! All thanks to Joe Simon. Joe was referred to me by a family fri...', p: [`I was a criminal and now I’m NOT! All thanks to Joe Simon. Joe was referred to me by a family friend (who is also an attorney) that said “I’m gonna give you Joe’s number, he’s the best in the field, and he’ll get the job done no questions asked.” Joe is a stand up guy that made the process easy for me. He helped me to lighten up about the situation, but took everything seriously to ensure the best outcome for me. He even helped me to work around my schedule as a student in a different city. I will recommend his name to anyone that needs his services!`], d: '2 years ago', g: '108584245753345718457' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe Simon and his team provided my family and I with incredible and compassionate support during ...', p: [`Joe Simon and his team provided my family and I with incredible and compassionate support during a very stressful time. Not only did he (and his team) guide us through every step of the legal process but he ensured an outcome more beneficial than we thought possible in our circumstance. There is no one in my life I would not entrust to Joe Simon to represent them and their best interests in a legal matter. In a real way, he saved who we are as a family.`], d: '4 years ago', g: '104209863922375606480' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'I am more than grateful for Mr. Simon’s prompt, personal, and expert work on my behalf. He kept m...', p: [`I am more than grateful for Mr. Simon's prompt, personal, and expert work on my behalf. He kept me updated constantly until my issue was resolved. Thank you, Mr. Simon!`], d: 'a year ago', g: '117217952955182696374' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'I totally recommend Joseph Simon’s office. The professionalism, accessibility to all team members...', p: [`I totally recommend Joseph Simon's office. The professionalism, accessibility to all team members and honesty were key points to build a relationship of trust. They handled the case in the best way possible with realistic expectations and great results. Finally, they have worked with me around my financial difficulties. I am more than satisfied and grateful.`], d: 'a year ago', g: '110463852500231693794' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe Simon and his office were very helpful in referring my husband and I to someone to represent ...', p: [`Joe Simon and his office were very helpful in referring my husband and I to someone to represent us in an automobile lawsuit.`], d: '3 years ago', g: '111672715020707125914' },
  { r: '5.0', h: "It's rare that you meet a professional that is excellent at their craft and compassionate to thei...", p: [`It's rare that you meet a professional that is excellent at their craft and compassionate to their clients. Joe treated my daughter as if she were his own. I could rest assured she had the best council possible.`], d: '6 years ago', g: '105350995167303308408' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe was a great attorney to have. He helped me with a legal matter which he resolved quickly and ...', p: [`Joe was a great attorney to have. He helped me with a legal matter which he resolved quickly and efficiently. He met me on a Sunday for a consult, and was very helpful all the way through the case. He knows everyone in Ann Arbor so he can definitely help you out of a jam if you find yourself in one. He was great through the whole process, and I would definitely hire him again if I were to get in trouble, but let’s hope that doesn’t happen.`], d: '6 years ago', g: '103686291696666333146' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'My husband and I consulted with Stephen Adams at the Joseph A Simmons law firm regarding a charge...', p: [`My husband and I consulted with Stephen Adams at the Joseph A Simmons law firm regarding a charge for our son. We found that Stephen was professional, very knowledgeable of both MI law and of the persons involved in the Washtenaw County justice system, and responsive. His advise was insightful and actionable. Highly recommend!`], d: '4 years ago', g: '103556494060511600471' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe helped my daughter and her friends with a completely unwarranted situation. He was instrument...', p: [`Joe helped my daughter and her friends with a completely unwarranted situation. He was instrumental in saving their reputations and their lives. There are no words or deeds to describe or reward him for this, so the best I can do is tell you to hire him. I consulted him frequently and under severe duress, and he was always kind, empathetic, responsive and engaged. We owe him the world and all involved have gone on to thrive. I can not do enough or say enough about the impact his work had. Hopefully these words will suffice!`], d: '2 years ago', g: '100989937230598668739' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'I could not be happier with my decision to hire Joe. He was recommended by someone I trust and I ...', p: [`I could not be happier with my decision to hire Joe. He was recommended by someone I trust and I never had any doubts about that decision.`], d: '4 years ago', g: '111675417359942379303' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Jorge Cisneros', p: [`went above and beyond when i made a free consultation call, very grateful!!`], d: '3 weeks ago', g: '109667343692063659932' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe Simon is simply the best lawyer you can have. He went far above and beyond in my case. He was...', p: [`Joe Simon is simply the best lawyer you can have. He went far above and beyond in my case. He was able to have my case resolved in a absolute miracle. He is extremely knowledgeable and will level with you and let you know exactly what probable out comes are and what to expect. His advice is also highly valuable. Following his advice allowed for a more favorable outcome than I could have expected. He cares deeply about his clients and is always prompt with communication. I highly recommend you higher him and watch the master work. He knows exactly how best to navigate the legal system and even all of the people involved. He knows exactly when to hold and when to press for the most favorable outcome. Do yourself a favor and hire Joe.`], d: '2 years ago', g: '107145046813492354431' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe and his team were the consummate professionals and helped us navigate successfully through th...', p: [`Joe and his team were the consummate professionals and helped us navigate successfully through this very difficult and challenging time. We could not have picked a better attorney to assist us and we could not have asked for a better outcome. Joe and his team were very prompt in their response to our situation immediately putting our concerns at ease and following through quickly and efficiently at every turn. His and his team's advice was spot on and the respect he gets from others in his legal community was clear to see. We will forever be in Joe and his team's debt and we highly, highly recommend Joe for his legal services.`], d: 'a year ago', g: '111731291139249609654' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'I was very unknown on what to do on my case. Then I found Joseph A. Simon searching on google and...', p: [`I was very unknown on what to do on my case. Then I found Joseph A. Simon searching on google and found a really knowledgeable person to take my case. He helped and assisted to with the flow of the case and answered all my questions that I had with clear answers. Victoria is always ready to answer any questions anytime and always supported for the case. The result of the case was very positive. I really want to appreciate the work done by Joe and Victoria for my case with the better result. Thank you so much.`], d: 'a year ago', g: '100587813910120245165' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe and his team were incredibly professional, caring, and hard working from the moment of first ...', p: [`Joe and his team were incredibly professional, caring, and hard working from the moment of first contact! I was incredibly nervous about the predicament I was in and his team put me at ease right away and guided me step by step through the entire process! In the end, the best possible outcome was realized and I cannot thank them enough..truly wonderful people that aren’t just good at what they do but also great genuinely good people!!`], d: 'a year ago', g: '100367345066934537183' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Mr. Simon and his team took what was a very hopeless case of mine and achieved the best possible ...', p: [`Mr. Simon and his team took what was a very hopeless case of mine and achieved the best possible outcome. He utilized patience, expert knowledge of the law / judicial process, and a firm stance with the prosecuting team. He was a joy to work with--very enjoyable at times, is extremely respectful and non-judgmental, and (he and) his staff demonstrate the utmost in professionalism. I hope I never have to work with him again, but rest easy knowing that he would be the best attorney choice for any criminal defense situation. Best of luck to you; Nathan A. Sten`], d: 'a year ago', g: '101514323748397743438' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Joe and his team did an amazing job for my daughter. They were amazing communicators, kept us app...', p: [`Joe and his team did an amazing job for my daughter. They were amazing communicators, kept us apprised every step of the way and explained every step as well. He was able to negotiate an amazing outcome. He took time to speak with me and my daughter and answered any questions that we had. I am thoroughly impressed with him and his office and highly recommend him as a lawyer.`], d: 'a year ago', g: '104546441116925415229' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'Mr. Simon is an excellent and well respected attorney. Highly recommend him for all of your crimi...', p: [`Mr. Simon is an excellent and well respected attorney. Highly recommend him for all of your criminal defense needs!`], d: 'a year ago', g: '102475407489210354384' },
  { r: '5.0', h: 'There is no one better. IGNORE THE REST JOE IS ABSOULTELY THE BEST. Your future may depend on you...', p: [`There is no one better. IGNORE THE REST JOE IS ABSOULTELY THE BEST. Your future may depend on you making the correct decision for representation. As a former client I can tell you there is none other than this man and his team. After hiring Joe throughout my process, every Judge, Bond /Probation Officer, Court clerk etc. comes across this mans name and nothing but reverence and admiration follows. Go with JOE`], d: '6 years ago', g: '102891071495558017061' },
  { r: '5', h: 'Best lawyer. Joe. Highly competent lawyer!', p: [`Attorney Joe is truly an excellent lawyer. My case was unique and complex, but he showed unwavering confidence. He ultimately resolved it quickly and accurately, despite not being in the U.S. due to circumstances. We communicated seamlessly through phone calls and video meetings. Additionally, Victoria at the office was incredibly kind and provided fast and clear updates about the case. They are indeed a highly competent lawyer and team! Don’t hesitate to contact him. The best lawyer in Michigan. You’ll regret hesitating. I highly recommend Attorney Joe! Lastly, I want to thank Joe and his team immensely. Greatly appreciated!!!!`], d: 'June 15, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Conscientious and Knowledgable', p: [`Handled the case very promptly. Fantastic team in his office. Sought information very readily, and had great contacts in order to resolve the matter.`], d: 'August 5, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Best Decision You Can Make', p: [`I had never found myself in a situation where I needed an attorney. Through very unfortunate circumstances, I quickly needed a criminal defense attorney. Through friends in the public defenders office, they said Joe Simon was the best out there. I met with Joe for an initial phone call and then a more in-depth meeting. Joe was thorough and listened to all parts. He and his assistant Victoria were so efficient in collecting all evidence, for being one step ahead in regards to my case and how it was proceeding. Joe took out all the guess work for a person like me who knew very little about our judicial system, especially from this side of things. Joe always took the time to explain things to me (sometimes more than once!) He always showed patience and empathy for me during one of the hardest chapters of my life, and for that I will be forever grateful. Joe is well respected by fellow attorneys, judges, and the office of probation for a reason. He treats everyone with respect but is also no nonsense when it comes to defending his clients. He has a quiet confidence that doesn't require volume or aggressive behavior. Joe is grounded in facts and a deep understanding of the law. I cannot say enough good things about the service Joe provides during what can be a very scary process. You would not regret having Joe on your side.`], d: 'July 10, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Stop looking, call Joe', p: [`I could not be happier with my decision to hire Joe. He was recommended by someone I trust and I never had any doubts about that decision. Joe was extremely thorough in explaining the entire process to me and always made sure I had all my questions adequately answered. Feeling comfortable and prepared about the process is invaluable in the courtroom.`], d: 'July 22, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Outstanding Attorney!', p: [`Joe Simon was on top of my case from the initial call. Joe and his staff are very professional and responsive.He is well established in the area court systems and went above and beyond to assist me in my case.`], d: 'July 25, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Amazing', p: [`Joe is an amazing lawyer he takes time to ensure you understand everything. Always available to talk and answer any questions. He is very personable. Joe amd Victoria genuinely care about you as a person and both are very kind and easy to talk to.`], d: 'July 31, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Peace of Mind', p: [`Joseph Simon is a fantastic attorney. I inadvertently landed in some trouble, and reached out to the law offices of Joseph Simon based on his high reviews. I spoke briefly with his paralegal, Victoria, before receiving a nearly immediate personal call back from Mr. Simon, who insisted I call him Joe. Joe talked to me throughout his entire lunch break, explaining all of the hypothetical avenues which might arise and made sure I understood each step of the process. He even did a brief investigation into the case to see what he could find. All of his advice and suggestions up to this point were free of charge! Because of his personable nature, lauded reputation and willingness to do leg work right away, I knew he was the right man for the job and asked him to take my case. This was a great decision. Joe and Victoria were always in my corner and I was able to have peace of mind during the entire process, which ultimately concluded with tremendous and victorious results on our end.`], d: 'May 28, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: '100% Recommend!!', p: [`Joe did such a wonderful job for me, he was able to turn such a awful circumstance into the best outcome! Joe worked so incredibly hard getting things moving where it seemed that nothing was ever going to get done. Highly recommend Joe for anyone looking for a Lawyer that cares about his clients and need the very best help!`], d: 'April 27, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Best DUI Lawyer', p: [`Mr. Simon took the time to explain to me the entire situation on day one. He went through all details, explained all costs, and after calling 15 or more lawyers, his price was the best option! Everything with my case went exactly as Mr. Simon explained, and it ended with a better outcome than anticipated. Mr. Simon and his team stayed in constant contact with me and explained everything every step of the way. Should I need a lawyer in the future, I will only be making one phone call. That call will be to Mr. Simon and his team. Thank you!`], d: 'April 23, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Family Case', p: [`We were thrust into an unexpected case for a family member and Joe took our case and resolved the conflict quickly and with a better result than could have been expected. A true professional. If you ever need an advocate, hire this team.`], d: 'April 27, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Best lawyer I have met', p: [`In my case, Joe and Victoria were extremely patient in explaining all the terms and possible consequences to me. They carefully and clearly outlined all the outcomes and patiently listened to my anxious descriptions and personal circumstances regarding the case. They provided all possible advice and perfectly achieved the results we expected. Many thanks to Joe. The best lawyers in the Ann Arbor area!`], d: 'April 17, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Best service!', p: [`Considering the reason why I had to obtain an attorney, I made the correct choice. To Victoria in his office, who constantly kept me informed of the process, to Mr Simon himself, taking the time to go over everything in detail. I would highly recommend.`], d: 'March 12, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Very professional and helpful criminal defense lawyer', p: [`provided extremely prompt and professional help throughout my criminal charge, which was eventually dismissed. Offered me a student discount as well!!`], d: 'February 22, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Great Lawyer', p: [`Mr. Simon is the utmost professional and worked with me to settle my case with the undeniable knowledge of our legal system. He went above and beyond, in my case, and I am truly happy I found him and was able to work with him. Highly recommend`], d: 'February 21, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Best DUI lawyer in town', p: [`I am truly impressed by the outstanding legal representation provided by Joe and his team. Their expertise and dedication in handling my case were evident from the beginning. They skillfully navigated the complexities of law, understanding the intricacies of the uncommon situation I was in, in great depth, and leaving no stone unturned to ensure the best possible resolution for me. What stood out the most was the lawyer's commitment to delivering results swiftly. Despite the time-sensitive nature of my case, they worked diligently to expedite the process without compromising the quality of their efforts. Their ability to manage time efficiently while maintaining a high standard of legal practice is commendable. Communication throughout the case was clear and transparent, instilling confidence and alleviating any concerns I had. Joe's team was always available to take my calls and later follow up via emails to make sure the entire process was completed seamlessly.`], d: 'December 27, 2023', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Joe is AMAZING!!', p: [`We are so thankful to Joe Simon for his defense of a family member who is a "vulnerable adult." We were referred to Joe by another attorney who highly recommended him. And indeed, Joe and team were amazing! He dug into the many complex details of the situation, and determined that the right thing to do was fight for a complete dismissal of the case. And, boy did he fight! To start, he took on the painstaking task of reviewing and understanding all the detailed complexities of the case, which prepared him to fight doggedly. He persisted, because he truly believed dismissal was the right outcome. He was determined to fight for it, and, indeed, he prevailed with the dismissal. He and his team were very professional, were great communicators, and kept us up-to-date promptly as the case progressed.`], d: 'November 26, 2023', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'highly recommended', p: [`was super professional and knowledgeable. everything went as he said it would . would whole heartedly recommend`], d: 'February 2, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Mr. Simon is the lawyer you trust with your life', p: [`I cannot express enough appreciation for Mr. Simon's work on my case. When facing a grave allegation for something you did not do, as occurred in my situation, you need a dedicated attorney with meticulous attention to detail, deep expertise, and tested experience in the issues who will communicate their strategy to you so that you can understand and see it.I experienced what it was like to work with an outstanding attorney who has all these attributes. I had complete confidence in Mr. Simon from our first meeting to the case's conclusion as he represented me and ultimately secured a favorable outcome in my case.`], d: 'May 30, 2024', a: true },
  { r: '5', h: 'Highly recommended', p: [`I had great communication from Joe at all times and he was very helpful while going through and understanding the courts process. Thank you for representing my case.`], d: 'January 17, 2024', a: true },
];

const pageTitle = 'Client Reviews | Law Offices of Joseph A. Simon — Ann Arbor Criminal Defense';
const pageDescription = 'Joseph A. Simon holds a 5.0 rating across 200+ Google reviews and a 10.0 rating on Avvo. Read what Ann Arbor criminal defense clients say in their own words.';
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} headerVariant="transparent">
  <section class="bg-[#061633] text-white relative overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:wlfwk8">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: url('https://jas-law-astro-review.netlify.app/hero-court-1.webp'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bimk"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(4, 16, 38, 0.97) 0%, rgba(5, 19, 45, 0.9) 46%, rgba(8, 26, 60, 0.62) 100%);" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bily"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 pt-[140px] pb-[60px]" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bilx">
      <div class="mb-4" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bilw">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#C9A840]/36 text-[#DDC582] text-[11.36px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1.5px] px-3 py-1 rounded-[2px]" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:z5g4jt">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"></path></svg>
          Client Reviews
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-[50.4px] font-black leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.6px] text-white mb-6 max-w-[900px]" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:drxyqu">What Our Clients Say.</h1>
      <p class="text-[19.04px] leading-[31.6px] text-[#C3CCDA] max-w-[820px] mb-8" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:nx7zlh">Joseph A. Simon holds a 5.0 rating across 200+ Google reviews and a perfect 10.0 rating on Avvo. When people face the hardest moment of their lives, this is how they describe the experience of being defended by our firm.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bilv">
        <a href="/#contact" class="bg-[#732521] text-white font-semibold text-[16.16px] px-[30px] py-[16px] rounded-[3px] hover:bg-[#5a1c19] transition inline-flex items-center gap-2" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:gta2x7">Request a Confidential Case Review <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
        <a href="tel:+17348876200" class="border border-white/30 text-white font-semibold text-[16.16px] px-[30px] py-[16px] rounded-[3px] hover:border-[#C9A840] hover:text-[#DDC582] transition inline-flex items-center gap-2" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:gta2x6">(734) 887-6200</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#0B1F42] py-[40px]" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:wlfwk9">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bilu">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-0" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bilt">
        <div class="text-center px-4 py-4" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bils">
          <div class="text-[42px] font-black text-white leading-none" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bilr">5.0</div>
          <div class="text-[#C3CCDA] text-[14px] font-medium mt-1" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bilq">Google rating <span class="text-[#C9A840]" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:z5g4ju">★★★★★</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center px-4 py-4 border-l border-white/10" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bilp">
          <div class="text-[42px] font-black text-white leading-none" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bil3">200+</div>
          <div class="text-[#C3CCDA] text-[14px] font-medium mt-1" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bil2">Google reviews</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center px-4 py-4 border-l border-white/10" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bil1">
          <div class="text-[42px] font-black text-white leading-none" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bil0">10.0</div>
          <div class="text-[#C3CCDA] text-[14px] font-medium mt-1" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bikz">Avvo "Superb" rating</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center px-4 py-4 border-l border-white/10" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18biky">
          <div class="text-[42px] font-black text-white leading-none" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bikx">196</div>
          <div class="text-[#C3CCDA] text-[14px] font-medium mt-1" data-ps="src/pages/reviews.astro:18bikw">Avvo client reviews</div>
        </div>
